        <mxCell id="e208" value="&lt;b&gt;HealthConnect Ghana: database (PostgreSQL 17)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;Read from a database with every migration applied (0000-0009). PK primary key · FK foreign key · '·' = required. Crow's foot = many. 16 tables + the view &lt;b&gt;surveillance_weekly&lt;/b&gt; (anonymised weekly counts, cells under 5 hidden). Workers' database roles (hc_chv, hc_clinician, hc_ghs_official, hc_auditor) see patient rows only in their district; access_log is append-only and hash-chained.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1880" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
